<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Bopogram: third-party licences</title>
<style>
body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 60em; margin: 2em auto; padding: 0 1em; }
pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #f4f4f4; padding: 1em; font-size: 0.85em; }
li { margin: 0.1em 0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Third-party licences</h1>
<p>Bopogram's programs are MIT licensed. They are built with the Rust crates below,
each under the licence shown with its full text. The models and the dictionary sources
have their own notices (NOTICE.txt in the model pack).</p>
<h2>Overview</h2>
<ul>
{{#each overview}}<li><a href="#{{id}}">{{name}}</a> ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<h2>Licences</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<h3 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h3>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul>
{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{#if crate.repository}} &mdash; {{crate.repository}}{{/if}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
